[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15721.349, "timestamp": "04:22:01", "text": "最近我接受了自己在这里的事实。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15724.51, "timestamp": "04:22:04", "text": "实际上就在这里，而且不仅仅是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15727.55, "timestamp": "04:22:07", "text": "梦。所以我觉得你可能会有这种感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15732.79, "timestamp": "04:22:12", "text": "也许吧。所以这件事一定会发生。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15737.03, "timestamp": "04:22:17", "text": "可以看到。我能想象自己会说出这样的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15740.07, "timestamp": "04:22:20", "text": "是的。就像在训练期间一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15743.83, "timestamp": "04:22:23", "text": "我以前借出的课程，比如我现在在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15753.07, "timestamp": "04:22:33", "text": "再见。该死。我找不到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15757.469, "timestamp": "04:22:37", "text": "我找不到我房间的照片。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15763.229, "timestamp": "04:22:43", "text": "这是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15765.83, "timestamp": "04:22:45", "text": "呃，是关于噪音投诉的事。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15768.87, "timestamp": "04:22:48", "text": "知道该怎么做。你检查过吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15771.99, "timestamp": "04:22:51", "text": "如果你能租到像kok房间那样的房间就好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15774.55, "timestamp": "04:22:54", "text": "或者别的什么，或者让咖啡馆之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15778.63, "timestamp": "04:22:58", "text": "网络房间之类的"}]